  width:22px. The stroke is deliberately thinner than the reference's 22 by 9,
  because at icon scale that weight reads as a hamburger menu control rather
  than as a blaze. See DESIGN.md section 3.

  Never enclosed in a circle, never given a gradient, never animated except the
  launch fade.
-->
